        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427870/extras/ec58cfb8ddf18f40b136349c6740b7e2.avif?t=1779726859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427870/extras_big/ec58cfb8ddf18f40b136349c6740b7e2.avif?t=1779726859 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Will Never Fall For My Tsundere Classmate, So I Will Just Date A Background Character Instead!</strong> is a free short parody visual novel. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a college student who is close to his female tsundere classmate. She is clearly the main heroine of this story, but will she actually end up being your romantic interest?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427870/extras/1c0979a1d661aa486a3dd391ae0e3ab1.avif?t=1779726859\" width=576 height=1080 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rikina</strong> is your tsundere friend and classmate. She can be a little grumpy at times, but is a good girl at heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VA: Savvi Lee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427870/extras/9089f57ac3a281936cee9d8301abf13e.avif?t=1779726859\" width=576 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rikina's friend</strong> is a quiet, unassuming girl also attending the same collega as you and Rikina. She is kind and loves monster movies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Will Never Fall For My Tsundere Classmate, So I Will Just Date A Background Character Instead! </strong>is a linear visual novel in which you read a short 30-minute romance story. You will be able to make a few choices that have no impact on the story. The game is accompanied by two soundtracks and contains full voice acting for Rikina.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427870/extras/ec58cfb8ddf18f40b136349c6740b7e2.avif?t=1779726859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427870/extras_big/ec58cfb8ddf18f40b136349c6740b7e2.avif?t=1779726859 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Will Never Fall For My Tsundere Classmate, So I Will Just Date A Background Character Instead!</strong> is a free short parody visual novel. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a college student who is close to his female tsundere classmate. She is clearly the main heroine of this story, but will she actually end up being your romantic interest?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427870/extras/1c0979a1d661aa486a3dd391ae0e3ab1.avif?t=1779726859\" width=576 height=1080 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rikina</strong> is your tsundere friend and classmate. She can be a little grumpy at times, but is a good girl at heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VA: Savvi Lee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427870/extras/9089f57ac3a281936cee9d8301abf13e.avif?t=1779726859\" width=576 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rikina's friend</strong> is a quiet, unassuming girl also attending the same collega as you and Rikina. She is kind and loves monster movies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Will Never Fall For My Tsundere Classmate, So I Will Just Date A Background Character Instead! </strong>is a 